  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      179.49,
      203.45,
      384.21,
      214.79
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE COMPANIES ACT, NO. 07 OF 2007",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.77,
      401.86,
      278.27
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Sri Lankan Constitution guarantees for equalrights for women to fulfill their potential and compete on afair playing field that takes into account their unique rolesand requirments:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      292.25,
      401.92,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS women's participation in the labour forceremains low and is on the decline, especially in the corporatesector, it has become necessary to make mandatorylegislative provisions for the inclusion of women on Boardof Directors in the Corporate sector to ensure corporategender equality, which would result in far reaching progressacross the economy:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.89,
      401.92,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE BE it enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      431.93,
      401.89,
      455.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Companies (Amendment)Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      480.05,
      401.89,
      528.83
    ],
    "text": "2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediatly after section 201 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 201A in the principalenactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      542.93,
      401.9,
      592.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c201A. If the number of directors in anycompany be three or more, one third of such numbermay be women where it is practicable to maintainsuch representation.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      606.41,
      401.9,
      630.47
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      434.11,
      447.58,
      443.18
    ],
    "text": "Short Title.",
